early Friday class vs 2.41 for students with no Friday class). \",\"document\",[]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1430,1721,\"Students who had classes beginning at 12 pm. or later consumed similar amounts as those with no Friday classes (M = 2.52). The magnitude of the Friday class effect was comparatively larger among males and among those who were members of the Greek system or participated in Greek activities. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s202\",\"d2\",0,385,\"---\\ntitle: Productions\\ndate: 2001-03-03\\n---\\nProductions\\n\\n2024-2025 Season\\n\\nTrue West\\n\\nBy Sam Shepard\\n\\nDirected by Zach Fischer\\n\\nAlbion Theatre closes the '24-25 season with the iconic comedy TRUE WEST by Sam Shepard. Austin is a straitlaced screenwriter on the verge of selling his next script. His brother Lee is a blustering drifter just back from three months in the Mojave desert. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s203\",\"d2\",385,735,\"When Lee charms his way into Austin's movie deal, they begin to transform into each other in a conflict that crescendos into chaos. At the Black Box Theatre (in the Dow Center). Admission is free. Mature audiences only.\\n\\nShowtimes:\\n\\nThurs., April 10 at 7:30pm\\n\\nFri., April 11 at 7:30pm\\n\\nSat., April 12 at 2:00pm & 7:30pm\\n\\nThurs., April 17 at 7:30pm\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s204\",\"d2\",735,1053,\"Fri., April 18 at 7:30pm (Post-show discussion with Cast & Crew)\\n\\nSat. April 19 at 2:00pm & 7:30pm\\n\\nHedda Gabler\\n\\nBy Henrik Ibsen\\n\\nDirected by Stephanie Henderson\\n\\nJust married. Bored already. Hedda longs to be free. Hedda and Tesman have just returned from their honeymoon and the relationship is already in trouble. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s205\",\"d2\",1053,1435,\"Trapped but determined, Hedda tries to control those around her, only to see her own world unravel. At the Herrick Theatre in the Dow Center. Admission is free. Not recommended for audiences under 18.\\n\\nAll performances are at the Herrick Black Box Theatre, in the Dow Center. Admission is free.\\n\\nPerformances:\\n\\nThursday, Feb. 13 at 7:30pm\\n\\nFriday, Feb. 14 at 7:30pm\\n\\nSaturday, Feb. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s206\",\"d2\",1435,1780,\"15 at 2:00 & 7:30pm (2 shows)\\n\\nThursday, Feb. 20 at 7:30pm\\n\\nFriday, Feb. 21 at 7:30pm (Post-show discussion with the Cast & Crew)\\n\\nSaturday, Feb. 22 at 2:00 & 7:30pm (2 shows)\\n\\nFirebringer\\n\\nBy Starkid\\n\\nDirected by Zach Fischer\\n\\nMusic Direction by Nicholas Laban\\n\\nThe Albion College Theatre Department presents Firebringer, a Stone Age musical!\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s307\",\"d3\",0,397,\"---\\ntitle: Vocal Area Network Choir Directory\\ndate: 2025-05-22\\n---\\n| Choir Directory |\\n\\nThe Vocal Area Network Choir Directory offers summary information\\n\\non over 500 choirs located around the New York-New Jersey-Connecticut\\n\\nmetropolitan area, compiled from groups' web sites, audition ads, flyers\\n\\nand other sources.\\n\\nUse this page and the Choir Auditions page to find the choir of your dreams! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s308\",\"d3\",397,742,\"You can also use Choirs by Night (sorted by rehearsal night) and Choirs by Locale (sorted by geography).\\n\\nTo list your choir or ensemble here, send us an e-mail with the following information: name, type of group, size, director, rehearsal night, rehearsal neighborhood, contact information (web site, e-mail, address, phone) and a brief blurb. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s309\",\"d3\",742,1139,\"Groups listed in the Choir Directory are entitled to an ongoing audition ad on the Choir Auditions page. Please send additions, updates, corrections and comments to Steve Friedman.\\n\\nNY\\n\\n(Manhattan)\\n\\n(Manhattan)\\n\\nA Capella Ensemble of NY\\n\\nA cappella ensemble\\n\\nA cappella ensemble\\n\\nA new a cappella choir whose goal is\\n\\nto be like the Orpheus Orchestra--perform with no conductor.\\n\\nNY\\n\\n(Manhattan)\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s310\",\"d3\",1139,1533,\"(Manhattan)\\n\\nA+ Jubliee Youth Chorale\\n\\nYo