se Realty Group, as well as WTVB AM 1590/FM 95.5 for their co-sponsorship of The 25th Annual Putnam County Spelling Bee as a part of this year's Summer Theatre Series. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14342\",\"d1\",1237,1396,\"Tibbits is tremendously excited to welcome Case Realty as a sponsor for […]\\n\\nFrederick Family Dental sponsors 'Little Shop of Horrors' at Tibbits Opera House\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15013\",\"d2\",376,734,\"owners: Dow Jones & Company\\nfounders: Charles Dow, Edward Jones, Charles Bergstresser\\nchiefeditor: Emma Tucker\\ndepeditor: Charles Forelle\\nmaneditor: Liz Harris\\nopeditor: Paul Gigot\\npublisher: Almar Latour\\nlanguage: English\\nheadquarters: 1211 Avenue of the Americas, New York City, New York 10036, U.S.\\npublishing_country: United States\\nstaff: 1, 800May 2025\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15012\",\"d2\",0,376,\"---\\ntitle: The Wall Street Journal - Wikipedia\\nauthor: Authority control databases National Germany France BnF data Sweden\\ndate: 2003-01-23\\n---\\nname: The Wall Street Journal\\nlogo: frameless|class=skin-invert|250px\\nlogo_border: yes\\nimage_size: 250px\\nimage_border: yes\\nimage_alt: border\\nmotto: It's Your Business\\ntype: Daily newspaper\\nformat: Broadsheet\\nfoundation: 8 July 1889\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15014\",\"d2\",734,1124,\"circulation: 3, 966, 000 news subscribers, * 3, 406, 000 digital-only, * 560, 000 print + digital\\ncirculation_date: June 2023\\ncirculation_ref: News Corporation 2023 the Annual Report on Form 10-K August 15, 2023 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission live April 27, 2024 PDF March 19, 2024\\nissn: 0099-9660\\neissn: 1042-9840\\noclc: 781541372\\n\\nname: OpinionJournal.com\\nurl: opinionjournal.com\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15015\",\"d2\",1124,1446,\"commercial: Yes\\ntype: News and opinion\\nlanguage: English\\nregistration: N/A\\nowner: The Wall Street Journal\\nauthor: The Wall Street Journal\\ncurrent_status: Redirects to wsj.com/news/opinion\\nrevenue: N/A\\n\\nThe Wall Street Journal (WSJ), also referred to simply as the Journal, is an American newspaper based in New York City. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15016\",\"d2\",1446,1731,\"The newspaper provides extensive coverage of news, especially business and finance. It operates on a subscription model, requiring readers to pay for access to most of its articles and content. The Journal is published six days a week by Dow Jones & Company, a division of News Corp.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15017\",\"d2\",1731,2093,\"As of 2023, The Wall Street Journal is the largest newspaper in the United States by print circulation, with 609,650 print subscribers. It has 3.17 million digital subscribers, the second-most in the nation after The New York Times. The newspaper is one of the United States' newspapers of record. The first issue of the newspaper was published on July 8, 1889. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15178\",\"d3\",0,382,\"---\\ntitle: History of WWE SmackDown - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2017-11-12\\n---\\nThe history of WWF/E SmackDown, began with the show's debut on August 26, 1999, in Kansas City, Missouri. The show was originally broadcast on Thursday nights but moved to Friday on September 9, 2005, before returning to Thursdays on January 15, 2015. On July 19, 2016, it was moved to Tuesday Nights. SmackDown! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15179\",\"d3\",382,695,\"debuted in the United States on the UPN television network on April 29, 1999, but after the merger of UPN and the WB, SmackDown! began airing on The CW in September 2006. The show was moved to MyNetworkTV in October 2008, to Syfy on October 1, 2010 and to USA Network on January 7, 2016.\\n\\nIn its WWF/E SmackDown! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15180\",\"d3\",695,998,\"history, SmackDown has been broadcast from more than 162 arenas, in more than 147 cities and towns, and in nine countries (the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Iraq in 2003 and 2004 for Tribute to the Troops, Japan in 2005, Italy in 2007, Mexico in 2011, and France and Saudi Arabia in 2024). \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15181\",\"d3\",998,1364,\"Prior to switching to the current live format, taped episodes premiered a few hours earlier in Ireland and the United Kingdom and a day earlier in Australia, Canada, and Singapore than the United States, due to time differences. The show celebrated its 15th anniversary on October 10, 2014, and its 1,000th episode on October 16, 2018.\\n\\nOriginal format (1999–2001)\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15182\",\"d3\",1364,1712,\"The early set included an oval-shaped TitanTron entrance and stage (dubbed the \\\"Ovaltron\\\") which made it stand out from the Raw set with its rectangular Titantrons. Later productions gained the ability to move the Ovaltron either to the left or to the right of the stage. Throughout the show's early existence, The Rock routinely called SmackDown! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15248\",\"d4\",252,614,\"JUNEAU, Alaska (AP) — The remains of all 10 people killed when their small plane crashed into ice on the Bering Sea have been recovered, authorities said.\\n\\nThe Nome Volunteer Fire Department made the announcement on its Facebook page Saturday afternoon. Recovery crews had been racing to recover the bodies before a winter storm was expected to hit the region.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15247\",\"d4\",0,252,\"---\\ntitle: The remains of all 10 people killed in Alaska plane crash have been recovered, authorities say\\nauthor: The Associated Press\\ndate: 2025-02-09\\n---\\nThe remains of all 10 people killed in Alaska plane crash have been recovered, authorities say\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15249\",\"d4\",614,991,\"\\\"All ten individuals aboard the Bering Air plane have been officially brought home,\\\" the fire department wrote in the social media post at about 3 p.m.\\n\\nCrews were still working on recovering the aircraft, the fire department said.\\n\\nThe Bering Air single-engine turboprop plane was traveling from Unalakleet to the hub community of Nome when it disappeared Thursday afternoon. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15250\",\"d4\",991,1160,\"It was found the next day after an extensive search with all nine passengers and the pilot dead, making it one of the deadliest plane crashes in the state in 25 years.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15251\",\"d4\",1160,1406,\"The aircraft is on an ice floe that is drifting about 5 miles (8 kilometers) a day, creating difficult conditions for recovery crews, said National Transportation Safety Board chair Jennifer Homendy during a press conference Saturday afternoon.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15252\",\"d4\",1406,1717,\"\\\"Please know that we'll work diligently to determine how this happened with the ultimate goal of improving safety in Alaska and across the United States,\\\" said Homendy.\\n\\nAs the community tried to process the deadly event, crews worked swiftly on unstable, slushy sea ice to recover the bodies and the wreckage. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15253\",\"d4\",1717,2001,\"The National Weather Service issued a winter weather advisory, with snow and winds up to 45 miles per hour (72 kilometers per hour) expected to hit the region Saturday night, lasting into Sunday evening.\\n\\nAmong those killed in the crash were Rhone Baumgartner and Kameron Hartvigson. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s15267\",\"d5\",0,256,\"---\\ntitle: Jacek Malczewski exchibition at National Museum in Krakow\\ndate: 2022-07-08\\n---\\nThe exhibition will focus on three themes originating in Romantic traditions and will present more than 150 works by Malczewski from museum and private collections.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15268\",\"d5\",256,654,\"Jacek Malczewski is one of the most outstanding individuals of Polish art, one who occupies a special place in the creative output of the Young Poland period.\\n\\nNational Museum in Krakow\\n\\nTHE MAIN BUILDING\\n\\nAL. 3 MAJA 1\\n\\n24th Great Dragon Parade\\n\\n06-06-2025Join us for the 24th Great Dragon Parade – one of the most spectacular open-air events in Poland!\\n\\nCraft Fair on Kraków's Main Market Square\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15269\",\"d5\",654,1042,\"23-05-2025We invite you to the unique Craft Fair on the Main Market Square in Kraków, where tradition is brought to life through handmade crafts.\\n\\nAbakanowicz. No rules. Sculptures in Wawel's Gardens\\n\\n07-05-2025Od 24 kwietnia w renesansowym ogrodzie Zamku Królewskiego na Wawelu można oglądać 14 plenerowych rzeźb najwybitniejszej polskiej rzeźbiarki. see the website for more details: \\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15270\",\"d5\",1042,1398,\"Mastercard OFF CAMERA festival\\n\\n25-04-2025The 18th edition of the Mastercard OFF CAMERA International Festival of Independent Cinema starts today and will last until May 4, 2025.\\n\\nHappy Easter\\n\\n18-04-2025May this Easter be as bright and cheerful as a spring day! Best wishes from Antique Apartments Team\\n\\nEaster Market on the Main Market Square in Kraków\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15271\",\"d5\",1398,1723,\"10-04-2025Easter Market on the Main Market Square in Kraków will take place from April 10 to April 21. The festive atmosphere is enhanced by charming decorations and spring greenery, including Emaus trees – symbols of rebirth and a nod to old traditions.\\n\\nThe Art Collection of the Society of Friends of Fine Arts in Kraków\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14343\",\"d1\",1396,1743,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House wishes to extend its sincere appreciation to Frederick Family Dental of Coldwater for its sponsorship of Little Shop of Horrors as a part of this year's Summer Theatre series, as well as its sponsorship support of the theatre for the past several years. Frederick Family Dental began sponsoring Summer Theatre […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14344\",\"d1\",1743,1845,\"Tibbits Opera House Welcomes The McCartney Years, a Tribute to the Music of Paul McCartney and Wings\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14345\",\"d1\",1845,2229,\"COLDWATER – Fans of Paul McCartney, whether they enjoy his time with The Beatles, with Wings or his extensive solo career, are invited to come experience a night at the 'Rock Show,' as The McCartney Years, a tribute to the music of Paul McCartney and Wings, arrives at the historic Tibbits Opera House on Saturday, […]\\n\\nParrish Excavating Sponsors 'Act Three' at Tibbits Opera House\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14346\",\"d1\",2229,2555,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House wishes to thank the team at Parrish Excavating for its sponsorship of the World Premiere of Act Three in this year's Summer Theatre series, as well as its sponsorship support of the theatre since 2017, and its overall support which goes on much longer still. Parrish Excavating has been a […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14347\",\"d1\",2555,2925,\"Coldwater Board of Public Utilities to Sponsor 'Million Dollar Quartet' at Tibbits Opera House\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House wishes to extend its appreciation to the Coldwater Board of Public Utilities for its sponsorship of Million Dollar Quartet as a part of this year's Summer Theatre series, as well as its sponsorship support of the theatre for the past decade. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14348\",\"d1\",2925,3256,\"CBPU and Tibbits Opera House share a foundation of […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House to Screen 'Wicked' as Part of Tibbits Film Series\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Whether you're an Elphaba or a Galinda, you're encouraged to grab your broom—or your wand—and come to Tibbits Opera House on Saturday, April 12, for the theatre's special screening of Wicked. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14349\",\"d1\",3256,3481,\"In addition, moviegoers are encouraged to come dressed as their favorite character, and join the party at Tibbits in the Ozdust Ballroom […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House Accepting Artist Submissions for Kids' Art Rocks Gallery Show\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14350\",\"d1\",3481,3839,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera Foundation and Arts Council invites young artists involved in any pre/K-12 curriculum to submit their art for the upcoming Kids' Art Rocks gallery exhibit. Kids' Art Rocks is a program of Tibbits and Arts Alive, which celebrates student art. Submitted artwork from students in or outside of Branch County, including homeschool […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14351\",\"d1\",3839,4137,\"Tibbits Opera House to Screen 'Pokémon: Detective Pikachu' as Part of Tibbits Film Series\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Grab your deerstalker cap and get ready to laugh, as Tibbits Film Series hosts a screening of the 2019 film Pokémon: Detective Pikachu on Saturday, March 29, at the historic Tibbits Opera House. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14352\",\"d1\",4137,4517,\"Loosely based on the 2016 video game released for the Nintendo 3DS, Detective Pikachu takes place in a world where […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House to Host 'Movies So Bad They Are Good' Series Featuring Cult Classic Films\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Film Series is set to host a series of films that can only be described as \\\"so bad they are good!\\\" on Tuesday evenings in March and early April. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14353\",\"d1\",4517,4732,\"Whether it's bad special effects, bad writing, bad acting or all of the above, people love bad movies. We especially love movies we […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House Set to Host 2025 Comedy Fest with Headliner John Heffron\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14354\",\"d1\",4732,5084,\"COLDWATER – Escape the late winter blues and have some laughs as Tibbits is excited to welcome comedian and Detroit native John Heffron to headline Tibbits' annual Comedy Fest, Saturday, March 15 at 7pm at the historic Tibbits Opera House. Two other Michigan-based comedians, Melissa Hager and Gerrit Elzinga, will be appearing as well. Energetic […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14355\",\"d1\",5084,5141,\"Tibbits Opera House Unveils 2025 Popcorn Theatre Season\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14356\",\"d1\",5141,5518,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Popcorn Theatre returns for its 38th season with family-friendly shows to fill Friday and Saturday mornings from June 6 through August 2, including three plays brought to life by Tibbits' professional Summer Theatre company members, a musical storybook from Kalamazoo Symphony Orchestra and the comedy magic of Jonathon LaChance. Popcorn Theatre kicks […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14357\",\"d1\",5518,5809,\"Tibbits Opera House to Host Exclusive Screening of 2025 Oscar Nominated Short Films\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Film Series is set to host an exclusive screening of the 2025 Academy Award-nominated animated and live-action short films on Saturday, February 15, at the historic Tibbits Opera House. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14358\",\"d1\",5809,6191,\"Tibbits is thrilled to bring this showcase to the Coldwater community, and offer a glimpse at these critically acclaimed short films. Film enthusiasts […]\\n\\nTibbits Annual Meeting Wrap-Up\\n\\nCOLDWATER –Tibbits Opera Foundation & Arts Council, Inc. held its annual meeting at the historic opera house on Thursday, January 23, immediately followed by the board's organizational meeting. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14359\",\"d1\",6191,6438,\"The theme that resonated through the evening was strength and adaptability. The Tibbits staff has grown, some roles have shifted, and it has worked to adapt to […]\\n\\nDon't miss 'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem' at Tibbits Opera House!\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14360\",\"d1\",6438,6793,\"A little bit of mayhem is on its way to Tibbits Opera House as the historic venue will screen Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem on Saturday, January 18, at 5pm, with a pizza party starting at 4pm. After years of being sheltered from the human world, the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles set out to […]\\n\\nTibbits Annual Meeting Slated for January 23\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14361\",\"d1\",6793,7132,\"COLDWATER – The annual meeting of the Tibbits Opera Foundation & Arts Council, Inc. will review the historic theatre's 2023-2024 fiscal year at 5:30 p.m. Thursday, January 23, 2025. \\\"The theatre's annual meeting gives us a chance to review the past year and show how we've been serving and engaging the community,\\\" said Tibbits Board […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14362\",\"d1\",7132,7449,\"Tibbits Opera House Welcomes Commotion: A Tribute to the Music of Creedence Clearwater Revival\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Get ready for a rocking, round-trip journey to the glory days of rock 'n' roll as Tibbits Opera House welcomes Commotion, a Tribute to the Music of Creedence Clearwater Revival, on Saturday, January 25, 2025! \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14363\",\"d1\",7449,7626,\"Featuring Steve McLain on lead vocals, with guitarist Jimmy Ryan, drummer Mark Ellis and bassist George Foster, Commotion […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House Announces 2025 Summer Season\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14364\",\"d1\",7626,7979,\"COLDWATER – Whether a monstrous tale straight from Skid Row, a legendary Rock 'n' Roll jam session, spelling bee drama, or a story of love and laughter among old friends, the 62nd consecutive season of Tibbits Summer Theatre offers audiences a fun-filled mainstage season featuring three distinct musicals and a world-premiere play, along with the […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14365\",\"d1\",7979,8367,\"Tibbits Young Audiences to Hold Auditions for \\\"The Enchantment of Beauty & the Beast\\\"\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Young Audiences invites students in fourth through eighth grades to audition for the spring production of The Enchantment of Beauty & the Beast. Auditions will be held on January 6 and 7 at 5pm at Tibbits Opera House. We all love the story of the prince who is cursed to be a […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14366\",\"d1\",8367,8749,\"Tibbits' Summer Theatre is Nominated for 2024 BroadwayWorld Michigan Awards\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits 2024 Summer Theatre has been nominated for a variety of awards on \\\"BroadwayWorld,\\\" an online theatre news publication. The site hosts regional awards for productions across the globe, with winners decided by a popular vote. Votes can be cast at:  and voting will conclude on 12/31/24. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14367\",\"d1\",8749,9039,\"Tibbits Opera House was nominated […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House Invites Artist Submissions for 'Opposites Attract' Gallery Show\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House invites artists of all ages and skill levels to submit their interpretation of the upcoming themed gallery show, \\\"Opposites Attract.\\\" \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14368\",\"d1\",9039,9267,\"This exhibition will explore things in this world that specifically attract each other due to the fact that they are opposites. Whether sweet and sour, yin and yang, ice cream […]\\n\\nArts Alive Announces 2025 Gallery Show Themes\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14369\",\"d1\",9267,9634,\"COLDWATER – From photography and paintings to sculptures and multimedia, from glitter to grunge, artists of all mediums are invited to enter their creative pieces in Arts Alive's upcoming gallery exhibits at Tibbits Opera House. Gallery shows for 2025 open for submissions by the public include \\\"Opposites Attract,\\\" \\\"Sunrise, Sunset,\\\" \\\"Bird is the Word,\\\" \\\"Kids' […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14370\",\"d1\",9634,9993,\"Tibbits Film Series Presents Die Hard!\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Whether or not you believe \\\"Die Hard\\\" is a Christmas movie, celebrate this iconic action film at Tibbits Opera House, December 20 at 6:30 pm, complete with a Nakatomi Christmas Party at 5:30 pm! Released in 1988, but set at Christmas time, \\\"Die Hard\\\" follows NYPD cop John McClane, who visits his wife […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14371\",\"d1\",9993,10282,\"Tibbits' 45th Annual Auction Takes a Time-Traveling Adventure with a \\\"Back to the Future\\\" Theme\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House is set to take guests on a thrilling journey back to the iconic 1980s with its 45th Annual Auction, themed \\\"Back to the Future,\\\" on Saturday, November 2, 2024. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14372\",\"d1\",10282,10681,\"This much-anticipated fundraising event is set to elevate the beloved tradition that has captivated audiences for the past 44 years, promising […]\\n\\nTibbits Young Audiences Presents \\\"Book Reports of Destiny\\\"\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Local students will showcase their creativity in Book Reports of Destiny at Tibbits Opera House on October 17 and 18 at 7 p.m., with a matinee performance on October 19 at 2 p.m. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14373\",\"d1\",10681,10937,\"This lively production transforms classroom book reports into an entertaining experience, captivating audiences with humor and imagination. The play's story […]\\n\\nA Classic Vampire Flick and Synth Punk Rock Make Tibbits 2024 Monster Fest a Must-See Event!\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14374\",\"d1\",10937,11306,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House will embrace the Halloween spirit with an unforgettable evening of live music and a cult classic film at Monster Fest 2024, on October 12. The event kicks off with a performance by the synth punk band Loser Candy at 8:30 p.m., followed by a screening of the 1986 vampire favorite […]\\n\\n\\\"Coldwater Kitchen\\\" Documentary Returns to Tibbits\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14375\",\"d1\",11306,11656,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Film Series is bringing back the powerful documentary \\\"Coldwater Kitchen\\\" for a special screening on October 4, with showings at 4:00 PM and 7:00 PM. This acclaimed film offers an insightful look into Chef Jimmy Lee Hill's renowned culinary training program at Lakeland Prison in Coldwater, Michigan. For 30 years, Chef Hill […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14376\",\"d1\",11656,12015,\"TYA Celebrates the Impact of Flagstar Foundation Grant\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Young Audiences (TYA) program at Tibbits Opera House fulfilled the generous Flagstar Foundation grant awarded last year. This support highlights the foundation's commitment to enhancing creative opportunities for underserved communities, with a particular focus on arts and culture. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14377\",\"d1\",12015,12391,\"Allocated from September 1, 2023, through July 31, 2024, the grant supported the productions […]\\n\\nLyrical Baritone Gerald J. Case-Blanchard and Pianist Wendy Chu Featured at Smith Memorial Concert\\n\\nCOLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House is set to present the 23rd Smith Memorial Benefit Concert on September 21. This year's event will feature celebrated lyric baritone Dr. Gerald J. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14378\",\"d1\",12391,12778,\"Case-Blanchard and accomplished pianist Dr. Wendy Chu, both internationally acclaimed performers. Dr. Gerald J. Case-Blanchard, from Philadelphia, is renowned for his powerful voice and notable operatic […]\\n\\nTibbits Opera House to Stage Pulitzer Prize-Winning Play \\\"Proof\\\"\\n\\nTibbits Opera House is set to present David Auburn's acclaimed play, Proof, from September 6 to 8, and 12 to 14. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s14379\",\"d1\",12778,13094,\"This Pulitzer Prize-winning drama, which originally premiered on Broadway in 2000, offers a profound exploration of the intersection between genius, mental health, and human connection. Proof follows Catherine, the daughter of a once-renowned mathematician […]\\n\\nGarth Brooks Tribute Band Takes the Stage at Tibbits\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s14380\",\"d1\",13094,13447,\"COLDWATER – Tibbits Opera House will host Fresh Horses, a Garth Brooks tribute band on August 23. Produced by Moxie Events, this highly anticipated show will celebrate one of country music's most legendary figures. Leading the tribute is the accomplished singer, actor, and musician Les Smith, renowned for his authentic portrayal of Garth Brooks. […]\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"learning institution matching all criteria\",\"time_scope\":\"as of 2023\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"4096\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"81574\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"71405\"